    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kukuelesha kwa waka nyuma ya kukufungua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukamzera Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuwizere wandu wa Israeli huwu, Iji muka wapata kifu, na kukufungua mwana wa womi, uchakaia useelie kwa matuku mfungade seji ukaiagha useelie ngelo yake ya meri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituku ja wunyanya, uo mwana uchashamishwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuz. 17.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 2.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko uo muka uchakaia matuku ghamu mirongo idadu na adadu, ukiweseria kuela kufuma kwa iro bagha rake; ndechaawada kilambo chingi chieleshero, hata kusoghoda kaavui na Andu kwa Wueli, hata matuku ghake gha kukuelesha ghakatia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela iji wakufungua mwana wa waka, uchakaia useelie kwa matuku ikumi na ana, seji ukaiagha ngelo yake ya meri; niko uchakaia matuku ghamu mirongo irandadu na arandadu ukikuweseria kueleshwa kwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Matuku gha kukuelesha kwake ghikakatia, ikaiagha ni gha mwana wa womi angu wa waka, uchareda mwana wa ng'ondi wa mwaka ghumweri kwa mkohani, mnyangonyi ghwa Hema ekwania kwa wundu ghwa kizongona chekora, na chana cha mbughi angu iringo, ikaie kizongona kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mkohani uchaifunya imbiri ya BWANA, upate kubonya mapatano kwa uo muka, nao uchaeleshwa kufuma kwa uko kufumwa ni bagha kwake. Ihi niyo Sharia kwa muka uo ose uchaakufungua mwana wa womi angu wa waka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji usedimagha kupata mwana wa ng'ondi, uchareda vana viwi va mbughi angu va maringo; imu kwa wundu ghwa kizongona chekora, na imu ichakaia kizongona kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a; na mkohani uchabonya mapatano kwa wundu ghwa uo muka, nao uchaeleshwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
